<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT WAIKATO 27-13.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FREE STATE BEAT WAIKATO 27-13.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waikato beat Free State 27-13 (half-time 10-13) in a Super 12 match at Free State Stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Free State- Tries - Johan Erasmus, Jan-Harm van Wyk, Jorrie Kruger, Braam Els, Conversions: M.J.Smith (2), Penalty: M.J.Smith</p>
<p>Waikato- Try - Michael Collins, Conversion - Matthew Cooper, Penalties: Cooper (2)</p>
